    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUR OTHER GAMES</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/20139649efba83c3113dd2759b9198e9.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;<strong>Why do you love me?</strong>&quot; - is a short kinetic novel in the &quot;<i>romance</i>&quot; genre.\u00a0<br>Apparently it is about love and relationship. About the difficulties that come within and how to overcome them.\u00a0<br>Players are given five stories.\u00a0<br>We hope our gane will help players in their relationship including self-reflection. On Valentine's Day and just everyday.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/3adbd6e37932aecf439c85ccaefc99c1.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Five unique sketches from our lives.<br></li><li>Graphics made with love.<br></li><li>A script made with heart.<br></li><li>Music made with money.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/fa6869eaca32f374d27f62dd36ed08e2.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>The game was created by two developers, Pasha and Sasha, who want to take this opportunity to say hello to their moms and dads.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/20139649efba83c3113dd2759b9198e9.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;<strong>Why do you love me?</strong>&quot; - is a short kinetic novel in the &quot;<i>romance</i>&quot; genre.\u00a0<br>Apparently it is about love and relationship. About the difficulties that come within and how to overcome them.\u00a0<br>Players are given five stories.\u00a0<br>We hope our gane will help players in their relationship including self-reflection. On Valentine's Day and just everyday.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/3adbd6e37932aecf439c85ccaefc99c1.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Five unique sketches from our lives.<br></li><li>Graphics made with love.<br></li><li>A script made with heart.<br></li><li>Music made with money.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802790/extras/fa6869eaca32f374d27f62dd36ed08e2.avif?t=1746189178\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>The game was created by two developers, Pasha and Sasha, who want to take this opportunity to say hello to their moms and dads.",
